  abstract      = "How can we explain the predictions of a black-box model? In
                   this paper, we use influence functions -- a classic technique
                   from robust statistics -- to trace a model's prediction
                   through the learning algorithm and back to its training data,
                   thereby identifying training points most responsible for a
