                   way in which \emph{reported} incidents of crime (those
                   reported by residents) and \emph{discovered} incidents of
                   crime (i.e. those directly observed by police officers
                   dispatched as a result of the predictive policing algorithm)
                   interact: in brief, while reported incidents can attenuate
