                   on Your Models",
  author        = "Sung, Nako and Kim, Minkyu and Jo, Hyunwoo and Yang, Youngil
                   and Kim, Jingwoong and Lausen, Leonard and Kim, Youngkwan and
                   Lee, Gayoung and Kwak, Donghyun and Ha, Jung-Woo and Kim,
