  address   = "New York, NY, USA",
  pages     = "746--754",
  abstract  = "We propose RelQuest, a conversational product search model based
               on reinforcement learning to generate questions from product
               descriptions in each round of the conversation, directly
               maximizing any desired metrics (i.e., the ultimate goal of the
               conversation), objectives, or even an arbitrary user satisfaction
