                   Algorithm Deployed in Ridehailing Marketplace",
  author        = "Eshkevari, Soheil Sadeghi and Tang, Xiaocheng and Qin, Zhiwei
                   and Mei, Jinhan and Zhang, Cheng and Meng, Qianying and Xu,
                   Jia",
  journal       = "arXiv [cs.LG]",
  abstract      = "In this study, a real-time dispatching algorithm based on
