                   and Huang, Boshuang and Chen, Peng and Xie, Xiaowen and
                   Belkin, Michael and Uryasev, Sal and Howie, Sam and Bakshy,
                   Eytan and Zhou, Norm",
  journal       = "arXiv [cs.LG]",
  abstract      = "Modern software systems and products increasingly rely on
                   machine learning models to make data-driven decisions based
                   on interactions with users, infrastructure and other systems.
                   For broader adoption, this practice must (i) accommodate
                   product engineers without ML backgrounds, (ii) support
