  journal       = "arXiv [cs.CL]",
  abstract      = "The scarcity of comprehensive up-to-date studies on
                   evaluation metrics for text summarization and the lack of
                   consensus regarding evaluation protocols continue to inhibit
                   progress. We address the existing shortcomings of
                   summarization evaluation methods along five dimensions: 1) we
                   re-evaluate 14 automatic evaluation metrics in a
