  abstract      = "Reward models (RMs) are at the crux of successfully using
                   RLHF to align pretrained models to human preferences, yet
                   there has been relatively little study that focuses on
                   evaluation of those models. Evaluating reward models presents
                   an opportunity to understand the opaque technologies used for
