  journal       = "arXiv [cs.IR]",
  abstract      = "Modern recommender systems perform large-scale retrieval by
                   first embedding queries and item candidates in the same
                   unified space, followed by approximate nearest neighbor
                   search to select top candidates given a query embedding. In
                   this paper, we propose a novel generative retrieval approach,
