  journal       = "arXiv [cs.CL]",
  abstract      = "This survey examines evaluation methods for large language
                   model (LLM)-based agents in multi-turn conversational
                   settings. Using a PRISMA-inspired framework, we
                   systematically reviewed nearly 250 scholarly sources,
