                   components of LLM-based agents for multi-turn conversations
                   and their evaluation dimensions, including task completion,
                   response quality, user experience, memory and context
                   retention, as well as planning and tool integration. These
                   components ensure that the performance of conversational
                   agents is assessed in a holistic and meaningful manner. The
                   second taxonomy system focuses on the evaluation
                   methodologies. It categorizes approaches into
                   annotation-based evaluations, automated metrics, hybrid
